Third-party patch, redistributed with attribution
-------------------------------------------------

  patches/0002-MoE-expert-cache-GPU-resident-LRU-cache-for-host-off.patch

is not my work. It is the GPU-resident LRU expert cache from llama.cpp pull
request #27861 by csantiago78:

  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/27861

The PR is unmerged at the time of writing. It was submitted to a public,
MIT-licensed repository, so it carries that project's license terms, and the
commit's original authorship is preserved in the patch header unchanged. It is
included here only so that the configuration this repository documents can
actually be reproduced.

Patches 0003, 0004 and 0005 are my changes on top of that work: a backend
synchronisation fix, a windowed admission gate, and telemetry. They are
described in the Flash-Next entry.

